      "post_subject": "Blizzard, and the 12 step program",
      "content_md": "OK, so it snowed like crazy here in Mass today, which provided a good excuse to stay home from work and finish up a few holographic projects!\n\nAnyhow, I have to confess that I've had a relapse. I ran dry of truly original ideas for subjects to holograph, so I resorted back to making holograms of Disney stuff. These subjects were all purchased in Florida a few years back.\n\nThey are all BB-640, 35mW Hene, JD-4 developer, Fe EDTA bleach, H2 reflection copies of original transmission masters. H2's have 3% TEA pretreatment.\n\nEnough talk - show the pictures!\n\n![Image](http://home.comcast.net/~stampydoo/buddha.jpg)\n\n![Image](http://home.comcast.net/~stampydoo/tinkandjiminy1.jpg)\n\n![Image](http://home.comcast.net/~stampydoo/tinkandjiminy2.jpg)\n\n![Image](http://home.comcast.net/~stampydoo/frog.jpg)",
